      },
      "source": [
        "#### Why arrays? The trouble with many variables"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9qJyS0rOvDFv"
      },
      "source": [
        "Suppose you have 5 test scores and want the average. With what you know so far, you would write one variable for each score:"
      ]
