      },
      "source": [
        "`list[a:b]` gives a **new list** from index `a` up to, but **not including**, index `b`. Leave `a` out to start at the beginning, leave `b` out to go to the end.\n",
        "\n",
        "| index | 0     | 1     | 2     | 3     | 4     | 5     | 6     |\n",
        "| ----- | ----- | ----- | ----- | ----- | ----- | ----- | ----- |\n",
        "| value | \"Mon\" | \"Tue\" | \"Wed\" | \"Thu\" | \"Fri\" | \"Sat\" | \"Sun\" |"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 6,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "HvVmmTp0vDF4",
        "outputId": "d2b7f743-3309-4f4b-f5a0-1198a1f363e4"
