      },
      "source": [
        "One day is split into four 6-hour periods. `temps[6:12]` takes indices 6 to 11 (06:00–11:00); index **12 is not included**. The third number is the **step**: `temps[::3]` takes every 3 hours, and a step of **-1** reverses the order."
