      },
      "source": [
        "Built-in functions summarise a whole array in one line. To know **at what hour** the highest temperature happened, combine `max()` with `index()`: `index()` gives its position, and in this data the position is the hour."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 15,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "-u8IArtbvDGB",
