    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "QgiFzvYBvDGC"
      },
      "source": [
        "`x in a` answers **whether it is there**, `a.count(x)` counts **how many times**, and `a.index(x)` gives the **first** position."
